Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	霖雨の火炉
	Desc	ゲーム開始時にボーナス <#c:00f>+6000
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(160%)
	Desc	MISS発生時 <#c:00f>+300
	
	Lang	en
	Title	Furnace of Drizzle
	Desc	Bonus <#c:00f>+6000<#r> at the start of the track.
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>160%<#r>.
	Desc	Bonus <#c:00f>+200<#r> for MISS.
	
	Attr	BNormal
	Indicator	INGuard	INBoost
	
	TargetChara	touhou/001/1

